title The circle in the middle
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  caption This circle sits right in the middle of the field.
  draw center-circle
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is that called?
  answer Center circle
  wrong Penalty area
  wrong Goal area
  wrong Halfway line
  correct Center circle.
  why Kick-offs happen at the center spot, and the other team stays outside this circle until the ball is kicked.
